  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Further developed and enforced models for ITD</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The Project is designed to contribute to development and enforcement of the European Union (EU) models for territorial development on national and local levels in Serbia. It was programmed as a part of the EU Action Document &#xbf;EU for Good Governance&#xbf; under the Instrument for Pre-accession Assistance (IPA III) National Action Programme for the year 2024.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Overall objective:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;To modernise public administration at all levels of government, as well as contribute to improvements to the requirements for EU accession, particularly in terms of governance and resource allocation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Purpose:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This Project will result in the establishment of key elements of the future national system for managing EU territorial instruments, while enhancing integrated and sustainable territorial development policies and facilitating their implementation.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
